          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• **The Watch app, the update hold, and a probe that asks the device what its own classes look like.**",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 10
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSubheaderView",
          "title": "v0.1.0",
          "useBoldText": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "• **A master switch, off until it is turned on.**\n• **Three switches rather than one**\n• **Every answer is counted.**",
          "useSpacing": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionSpacerView",
          "spacing": 10
        }
